      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Société Française du Cancer. Published by Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "In September 2016 in Lille, France, the Francophone Society of Bone Marrow Transplantation and Cellular Therapy (SFGM-TC) organized the 7th Allogeneic Stem Cell Transplantation Clinical Practices Harmonization Workshop Series. Our work group focused on chemotherapy drug dose adaptation for hematopoietic stem cell transplantation patients presenting a comorbidity. The purpose of this workshop was to provide recommendations on chemotherapy drug dose adaptation for patient populations receiving hematopoietic stem cell transplantation who also had the following comorbidities: obesity, chronic kidney disease and hepatopathy."
      },
